g for a spark, looking for the light.\nFound a new node, crafted by a wizard’s hand,\nThe finest bit of kit in all the digital land.\nThey don’t want my money, they don’t want a fee,\nJust a star on the GitHub for the world to see.\n\n[Chorus - Melodic, soaring, and incredibly catchy]\nOh, the open source is a beautiful thing!\nLike a summer breeze that makes the GPU sing!\nFrom the halls of Hugging Face to the Comfy track,\nThe community’s got the Alchemist’s back!\nSharing the fire, sharing the soul,\nKeeping the creative world in control!\n\n[Verse 2]\nNo paywalls here, no corporate chains,\nJust the brilliant spark of those collective brains.\nThey’re building the future, node by node,\nLightening the weight of the creative load.\nFit and gorgeous workflows, running so smooth,\nGiving the whole industry a cheeky little soothe.\n\n[Bridge - Stripped back with a rhythmic clap and smooth synth bass]\nIt’s a global party, everyone’s invited...\nWhen a new model drops, we all get excited!\nNo gatekeeping here, just pure innovation...\nThe heartbeat of a brand new generation!\n\n[Chorus - Full energy return, rhythmic and groovy]\nOh, the open source is a beautiful thing!\nLike a summer breeze that makes the GPU sing!\nFrom the halls of Hugging Face to the Comfy track,\nThe community’s got the Alchemist’s back!\n\n[Outro - Fading rhythmic synths, playful female vocals]\nThank you for the nodes...\nThe wizards of the code...\nTensor Alchemist... out.\n[End]",31,"fixed",112,120,"4","en","E major",true,2,0.85,0.9,0,0.001],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":108,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-691.0515865540128,-872.4115199069222],"size":[520,530],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## Model Links (for Local Users)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [acestep_v1.5_xl_turbo_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ace_step_1.5_Com